{
 "artifact": "examples/verified-knowledge-ledger/demo.partner-style.html",
 "artifact_id": "pp_c5949563fc662476994db4f8",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>The verified knowledge ledger<span>for autonomous AI agents.</span></h2>",
   "id": "67be4882",
   "hash": "b780cdf8cf68"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p class=\"tour-lede\">A cumulative knowledge system powered by verification, traceability, and governance.</p>",
   "id": "6e4ac837",
   "hash": "294852d88bb0"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 class=\"section-title\">Agents remember more.<span>But memory is not trust.</span></h2>",
   "id": "9b7bc598",
   "hash": "e4811b7646a1"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Observability</h3>",
   "id": "093934d3",
   "hash": "18abebc2ccf2"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>What happened?</p>",
   "id": "31c19cab",
   "hash": "f328451e5294"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Memory + ontology</h3>",
   "id": "b4b90585",
   "hash": "2e469d7c847a"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>What should be carried forward?</p>",
   "id": "676412d2",
   "hash": "94d26c97d5bf"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Proofpress</h3>",
   "id": "e2163537",
   "hash": "10d1e1b52040"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>What may be relied on—and why?</p>",
   "id": "4a6c7b6e",
   "hash": "f8784456631a"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 class=\"section-title\">From traces<span>to governed knowledge.</span></h2>",
   "id": "68accac5",
   "hash": "975dc4f6bbbf"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 class=\"section-title\">Which conclusions<span>become knowledge?</span></h2>",
   "id": "aa8102c4",
   "hash": "42f1b0deb838"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 class=\"section-title\">Does verified continuity<span>improve the long-horizon baseline?</span></h2>",
   "id": "8a674112",
   "hash": "6d1fb4fef315"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>The Harvey benchmark is eval only. Replace this placeholder with the measured result from the separate benchmark run—never with demo data.</p>",
   "id": "e417ce97",
   "hash": "5047a9fea289"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p class=\"eval-caption\">Result intentionally blank · populate with the separate Harvey benchmark's actual baseline, treatment, denominator, and confidence interval.</p>",
   "id": "2bc15033",
   "hash": "cd1aa579c3a0"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 class=\"section-title\">The analyst works.<span>The organization governs.</span></h2>",
   "id": "b6b4cb57",
   "hash": "c4c5479fca50"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>BBDC / TVPG merger analysis</h3>",
   "id": "f709c3f0",
   "hash": "8d692963b3bd"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>The analyst sees the conclusion and its trust state in the same workflow.</p>",
   "id": "24a1ba3d",
   "hash": "bb3adef07ddc"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Safe to reuse</h3>",
   "id": "ff329ce6",
   "hash": "b4edbd4f9b80"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Run, evidence, reviewer, and scope travel with the conclusion.</p>",
   "id": "d007e1f1",
   "hash": "22fbbdce1a19"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Fable 5</h3>",
   "id": "19c1161d",
   "hash": "66cdd8673336"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>53.2% · evidence complete</p>",
   "id": "d3505b5d",
   "hash": "f284d0f0b056"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Opus 4.8</h3>",
   "id": "7dd720db",
   "hash": "a7d4a5591a7f"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>51.2% · evidence complete</p>",
   "id": "0c0a98c5",
   "hash": "87fea930cd8e"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>GLM-4.7</h3>",
   "id": "231125c5",
   "hash": "d22c26866658"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>8.7% · incomplete evidence</p>",
   "id": "cc5c1ebe",
   "hash": "82beab6c0c67"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>What enters shared knowledge?</h3>",
   "id": "d02ce2d7",
   "hash": "295fdbd67643"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 class=\"section-title\">The same trust contract.<span>A different operational surface.</span></h2>",
   "id": "c2ec8e67",
   "hash": "7a674a1d7be0"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p class=\"tour-lede\">Commerce is not another finance graph. It is a telemetry-to-trusted-action view across policy, payment, fulfillment, and disputes.</p>",
   "id": "9a956087",
   "hash": "747e1cf461ca"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>From autonomous agents<span>to self-improving companies.</span></h2>",
   "id": "e3cb86a6",
   "hash": "c2613f4dbdf6"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h1>THE WORK OUTLIVED THE CONTEXT.<span>WHICH CONCLUSION CAN THE NEXT AGENT TRUST?</span></h1>",
   "id": "26127b71",
   "hash": "f6e81ecd8bd9"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Long-horizon work is a chain of coupled decisions across contexts and tasks. Proofpress makes selected conclusions <strong>evidence-bound, governed, and safe to inherit.</strong></p>",
   "id": "59111a7d",
   "hash": "6672acd73ab3"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>What can the next agent safely inherit?</h2>",
   "id": "ad5a4616",
   "hash": "7bf7a25fb307"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Choose one experiment first. Open lineage only when you need to inspect how the decision was made.</p>",
   "id": "52ab68ed",
   "hash": "9bd4c357bc7e"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3 id=\"paperTitle\">Candidate B increased conversion.</h3>",
   "id": "03df410b",
   "hash": "b03b4c251ede"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p id=\"paperBody\">This is the result a fresh agent may want to reuse. The ledger keeps it attached to its measured run and review state.</p>",
   "id": "e165f27d",
   "hash": "349ef2d7bb83"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3 id=\"title\">Candidate B is eligible for review.</h3>",
   "id": "5d58db33",
   "hash": "2196970f1337"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p id=\"body\">Evidence is present, the experiment completed, and the metric is measured. A human or policy reviewer still decides whether this belongs in shared knowledge.</p>",
   "id": "105f3c7c",
   "hash": "ce338dcfd6c9"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2>The decision is a path, not a note.</h2>",
   "id": "185f2164",
   "hash": "5dbde752a997"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p>Every reusable claim keeps its source, experiment, evidence status, review state, and the prior knowledge it builds on.</p>",
   "id": "5a61ca84",
   "hash": "3d53f06b602b"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "<p class=\"evidence-note\">Evidence stays attached to the claim it supports, so the next person or agent can inspect the boundary instead of trusting a summary.</p>",
   "id": "54cf5ec6",
   "hash": "8499aa62ce63"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h2 id=\"drawerTitle\">Candidate B · eligible for review</h2>",
   "id": "c0058247",
   "hash": "63ae8506c20f"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "<h3>Deterministic admission checks</h3>",
   "id": "2d1205a7",
   "hash": "0db8554af39d"
  }
 ]
}